Check Where Log written? (5a) Transaction log S3 bucket, by date/prefix. The writer is <code>uw-rules-engine-cert</code>; check its CloudWatch Logs if the file is missing. Lambda triggered? (5b) S3 event notification config; CloudWatch Logs for AWS2SF Trans Log Pipe. Load succeeded? (5c) Lambda errors, Snowflake <code>QUERY_HISTORY</code> / <code>COPY_HISTORY</code> for the historical table. Duplicates? S3 events are at-least-once; ensure loads are idempotent (e.g. MERGE on a transaction id) (inferred). <pre><code>-- Example: what reached the historical table recently
SELECT COUNT(*), MAX(&lt;event_ts&gt;) FROM &lt;db&gt;.&lt;schema&gt;.&lt;historical_table&gt;
WHERE &lt;event_ts&gt; &gt; DATEADD(hour, -1, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP());
</code></pre>

In <code>when</code> (which rows) In <code>then</code> (what must hold) Meaning <code>FIELD: value</code> <code>FIELD: value</code> is / must be that value <code>FIELD: [a, b]</code> <code>FIELD: [a, b]</code> is / must be one of them <code>FIELD: present</code> / <code>missing</code> <code>FIELD: present</code> / <code>missing</code> has a value / is empty <code>{not: v}</code>, <code>{not_in: [a, b]}</code> the same is not / must not be <code>{at_least: n}</code>, <code>{at_most: n}</code>, <code>{above: n}</code>, <code>{below: n}</code>, <code>{between: [lo, hi]}</code> the same number comparisons (<code>above</code> / <code>below</code> exclude the limit) <code>{matches: regex}</code>, <code>{not_matches: regex}</code> must (not) match a pattern <code>{length_between: [lo, hi]}</code> must be lo to hi characters long <code>{equals_field: OTHER}</code> must equal another field of the same row <p>Several words can be combined on one field: <code>MF_SCORE: {at_least: 300, at_most: 900}</code>. Empty values are not judged by value requirements, as in GX; add <code>FIELD: present</code> to require a value. Quote values YAML would read as something else: <code>'1'</code>, <code>'yes'</code>, <code>'Y'</code>.</p> <p>For example, "either field empty" is a list of <code>when</code> groups:</p> <pre><code>    when:
      - {SSN_LAST4: missing}
      - {TAX_ID_LAST4: missing}
    then: {SSN_TAX_ID_MATCH: Z}
</code></pre>
